# This file is NOT inherited. GitHub's default community health files are limited to
# CODE_OF_CONDUCT, CONTRIBUTING, discussion category forms, FUNDING, GOVERNANCE, issue and
# pull request templates with config.yml, SECURITY and SUPPORT. `.gitignore` is not on that
# list, so nothing here reaches the other 39 repositories — it applies to this one only.
#
# Deliberately short. This repository holds Markdown, YAML templates and one bash script:
# no build, no dependency tree, no language runtime, and therefore no build artefacts to
# exclude. Every entry below is here because it has actually appeared in this working tree
# or because tooling used on this repository creates it. Nothing is here by template.

# --- macOS ---
# .DS_Store is the one that genuinely turns up; the rest are resource-fork debris that
# appears when files round-trip through a non-HFS volume or an archive.
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# --- Claude Code ---
# `.claude/` itself is meant to be committed — settings.json, agents and skills are shared
# project config. Two exceptions:
#   - worktrees/ holds full nested checkouts created by EnterWorktree or `--worktree`, which
#     would otherwise show up as a large untracked directory
#   - *.local.json is per-developer override, and is gitignored by Claude Code's own
#     convention rather than shared
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/**/*.log
CLAUDE.local.md

# --- Scratch working files ---
# Handover notes, copy-paste instructions for steps that need a human, and throwaway test
# harnesses. Never committed.
.scratchpad/

# --- Editors ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*~
*.swp
